ess Unit Project Management (J17D) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time ongoing positionRemuneration: $126,140 p.a. plus Superannuation and Leave LoadingBased at Parramatta City campus About The College Western Sydney University The College is a not-for-profit Reference a383e3b9-d4e3-45fe-81e6-333e4c7cc8df Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Managing Counsel Salary Location Parramatta, AU Division Vice-Chancellor & President Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Legal, Compliance & Governance (U47B) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Senior Description Fulltime, 5-year fixed term contract, Senior-level position.Parramatta South campus with flexible working arrangements.Shape sound decisions through strategic, commercially focused legal advice. Prov Reference 91f8de43-c1d2-4fcc-b29a-1a43450be13e Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Workforce Reporting Analyst Salary Location Richmond, AU Division Operations Brand Western Sydney University Location Richmond Business Unit People and Culture (U76E) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, Ongoing position at HEW Level 7.Come and join our team at Hawkesbury campusSalary: $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Turn complex workforce data into trusted i Reference 50d75530-607d-459c-b411-013e1c3ca41c Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer / Associate Professor in Surgery Salary Location Parkside Cres, Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time, Ongoing position at Academic Level C or D.Macarthur Clinical School location.Salary: Level C $152,333 – $174,978 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading (Pro-rata). Level D $182,520 – Reference b61a3114-6e3c-4677-ae51-310555bda346 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer/ Associate Professor, Critical Care Salary Location Parkside Cres, Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description 0.2 FTE Part-time, Ongoing position at Academic Level C or D.Macarthur Clinical School.Salary: Level C $152,333 – $174,978 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading (Pro-rata). Level D $182,520 – Reference 054875d6-1514-4b91-8e4e-98ddb339f48d Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
