 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Senior Lecturer / Associate Professor in Surgery Salary Location Parkside Cres, Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Part-Time Position Category Academic Description Part-time, Ongoing position at Academic Level C or D.Macarthur Clinical School location.Salary: Level C $152,333 – $174,978 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading (Pro-rata). Level D $182,520 – Reference b61a3114-6e3c-4677-ae51-310555bda346 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
